    "bubble_choice_description": "Add a count message, a filter summary label, and a friendly empty state to a restaurant search app.",
    "long_instructions": "## Restaurant Finder\r\n\r\n**Goal:**\r\nImprove the restaurant search app with clear transparency cues so users always know what’s shown, which filters are active, and what happens when no results appear.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n1. **Open `script.js`.**\r\n   Find the `render()` function. This is where the restaurant list is built.\r\n\r\n2. **Add three messages to improve clarity:**\r\n\r\n   * **Count message:**\r\n     Update `#countMessage` to show how many results are displayed out of the total.\r\n     Example: `Showing 4 of 12 results`\r\n\r\n   * **Filter label:**\r\n     Update `#filterLabel` to summarize the active filters in plain language (e.g., cuisine, max price, “open now”).\r\n\r\n   * **Empty-state message:**\r\n     If no results match, show a friendly message in `#emptyMessage`, such as: \"No restaurants match your selection.\"\r\n\r\n3. **Test your work.**\r\n\r\n\r\n4. **Use AI to check your reasoning:**\r\n\r\n   * “Explain what my filter condition is doing and when it returns 0 results.”\r\n   * “Is my count message still accurate when the dataset is empty?”\r\n   * “Suggest three concise, friendly versions of my empty-state message.”\r\n",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Restaurant Finder — Adding Transparency</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <h2>Restaurant Finder</h2>\n\n  <p id=\"countMessage\"></p>\n  <p id=\"filterLabel\"></p>\n\n  <ul id=\"restaurantList\"></ul>\n  <p id=\"emptyMessage\"></p>\n\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "active": true,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "body {\n  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  background-color: #f9f9f9;\n  color: #222;\n  margin: 40px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\nh2 {\n  color: #333;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n#countMessage,\n#filterLabel {\n  background: #fff;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  display: inline-block;\n  margin-right: 8px;\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n}\n\n#countMessage {\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n#filterLabel {\n  color: #555;\n  font-style: italic;\n}\n\n#emptyMessage {\n  color: #666;\n  font-style: italic;\n  background: #fff3f3;\n  border-left: 4px solid #e57373;\n\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  margin-top: 10px;\n}\n\n#restaurantList {\n  list-style: none;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin-top: 16px;\n}\n\n#restaurantList li {\n  background: #fff;\n  margin: 8px 0;\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n}\n\np {\n  margin: 6px 0;\n}\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "// --- Sample data (toggle to test) ---\nconst restaurants = [\n  { name: \"Luna Verde\", cuisine: \"Mexican\", price: 2, open: true },\n  { name: \"Brick & Basil\", cuisine: \"Italian\", price: 3, open: false },\n  { name: \"Chili & Lime\", cuisine: \"Thai\", price: 1, open: true },\n  { name: \"Docks Diner\", cuisine: \"American\", price: 2, open: true },\n  { name: \"Tivoli\", cuisine: \"Italian\", price: 4, open: true },\n  { name: \"Sunset Grill\", cuisine: \"American\", price: 3, open: false }\n];\n// const restaurants = []; // test with an empty list\n\nconst render = () => {\n  \n  const list = document.getElementById(\"restaurantList\");\n  const countMsg = document.getElementById(\"countMessage\");\n  const filterLabel = document.getElementById(\"filterLabel\");\n  const emptyMsg = document.getElementById(\"emptyMessage\");\n\n  list.innerHTML = \"\";\n\n  // Filters for any cuisine, price, and open restaurant\n  const cuisine = \"any\";\n  const maxPrice = 3; // represents $$$\n  const openNow = true;\n\n  const results = [];\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < restaurants.length; i++) {\n    const r = restaurants[i];\n\n    let cuisineOk;\n    if (cuisine === \"any\") {\n      cuisineOk = true;\n    } else {\n      cuisineOk = r.cuisine === cuisine;\n    }\n\n    const priceOk = r.price <= maxPrice;\n\n    let openOk;\n    if (openNow === false) {\n      openOk = true;\n    } else {\n      openOk = r.open === true;\n    }\n\n    if (cuisineOk && priceOk && openOk) {\n      results.push(r);\n\n      // Build price symbols\n      let priceSymbols = \"\";\n      for (let j = 0; j < r.price; j++) {\n        priceSymbols = priceSymbols + \"$\";\n      }\n\n      // Set open/closed text\n      let status = \"Closed\";\n      if (r.open === true) {\n        status = \"Open\";\n      }\n\n      const li = document.createElement(\"li\");\n      li.textContent = r.name + \" — \" + r.cuisine + \" — \" + priceSymbols + \" — \" + status;\n      list.appendChild(li);\n    }\n  }\n\n\n  \n};\n\nrender();",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "1",
        "2",
        "3"
      ]
    },
